{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48217","headline":"嘲格辅元 · 杜易简","name":"嘲格辅元","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"有耻宿龙门，精彩先瞰浑。\n眼瘦呈近店，睡响彻遥林。\n埒囊将旧识，制被异新婚。\n谁言骢马使，飜作蛰熊蹲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜易简","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_48217.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48217","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}